{"id":"n48221-1-9","stage":3,"title":"되도록 · 尽量","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48221-1-9-1","ko":"이 서류는 언제까지 처리하면 되나요?","zh":"这份文件需要什么时候处理完呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"서류는","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서류는","audio":"/audio/81c9f807687ff6d9d222.mp3"}},{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：疑问词“什么时候”；结合本句询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제까지","audio":"/audio/8902d9621c6f3af4db86.mp3"}},{"text":"처리하면","meaning":"处理，办理，受理","explanation":"처리하다：处理，办理，受理；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"처리하다","audio":"/audio/e9cb6f08d29afdcfefb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78720","senseId":"1","lemma":"처리하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처리하면","audio":"/audio/3ac33e7891dba1edd71a.mp3"}},{"text":"되나요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되나요","audio":"/audio/7ee6d2f020195c6ebb22.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"什么时候","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"e9cb6f08d29afdcf","term":"처리하다","zh":"处理，办理，受理","audio":"/audio/e9cb6f08d29afdcfefb2.mp3","entryId":"78720","definition":"按步骤整理并完成工作、业务或案件等。","pronunciation":["처ː리하다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c967359aa0aef35f666e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n48221-1-9-2","ko":"급한 거니까 되도록 빨리해 주세요.","zh":"因为很紧急，麻烦尽量快一点处理。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"급한","meaning":"急","explanation":"급하다：急；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"급하다","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86862","senseId":"1","lemma":"급하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"급한","audio":"/audio/7a0bb6f355fdc74035ac.mp3"}},{"text":"거니까","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니까","audio":"/audio/1f361968583a107906f4.mp3"}},{"text":"되도록","meaning":"尽量","explanation":"되도록：尽量。","readings":[{"term":"되도록","audio":"/audio/847049d3a43266cc285f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48221","senseId":"1","lemma":"되도록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되도록","audio":"/audio/847049d3a43266cc285f.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리해","meaning":"快，迅速","explanation":"빨리하다：快，迅速；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"빨리하다","audio":"/audio/e14f1dd1d31cd27bc359.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61185","senseId":"1","lem